---
description: Iqra Workshop Wall — how contributions work
alwaysApply: true
---

- This repo is a Next.js (static export) site that renders one card per
  workshop participant.
- Participants live in `participants/<cohort>/<github-username>.md`. Each file
  has YAML frontmatter: `name`, `github`, `id`, `semester`, `department`,
  `skills` (a list), followed by an optional one-line bio.
- The current cohort folder is `participants/2026-nov/`.
- ONE new file per person. Never edit someone else's file — separate files are
  what keep contributions conflict-free (no merge conflicts).
- After adding or changing a participant file, run `npm run validate`.
- Keep guidance beginner-friendly; many contributors are opening their first PR.
